---
// Binlog CDC Asynchronous Cache Invalidation Flow Component
---

<figure class="cdc-diagram" aria-labelledby="cdc-diagram-caption">
  <!-- Desktop SVG layout (ViewBox 840x260, large clear text, 25px+ bottom margin) -->
  <svg
    class="cdc-diagram__desktop"
    viewBox="0 0 840 260"
    role="img"
    aria-labelledby="cdc-diagram-title cdc-diagram-desc"
  >
    <title id="cdc-diagram-title">
      Binlog CDC 變更捕獲與非同步快取淘汰架構圖
    </title>
    <desc id="cdc-diagram-desc">
      展示應用服務寫入 MySQL 主庫，CDC 引擎（Canal/Debezium）捕獲 Binlog
      並發送至 Kafka 訊息佇列，快取淘汰 Worker 非同步冪等刪除 Redis 快取。
    </desc>

    <defs>
      <marker
        id="cdc-arrow"
        viewBox="0 0 10 10"
        refX="7"
        refY="5"
        markerWidth="6"
        markerHeight="6"
        orient="auto"
      >
        <path d="M 0 1 L 8 5 L 0 9 z" class="cdc-diagram__arrow-head"></path>
      </marker>
    </defs>

    <!-- Outer Box (Height: 215, Bottom spacing: 25px) -->
    <g transform="translate(20, 20)">
      <rect width="800" height="215" rx="12" class="cdc-diagram__card"></rect>
      <text class="cdc-diagram__badge" x="20" y="26"
        >CDC ASYNC INVALIDATION ARCHITECTURE</text
      >
      <text class="cdc-diagram__title" x="20" y="48"
        >MySQL Binlog CDC 非同步解耦快取淘汰流程</text
      >

      <!-- Step 1: App (X: 20, Y: 70, W: 155, H: 65) -->
      <g transform="translate(20, 70)">
        <rect
          width="155"
          height="65"
          rx="8"
          class="cdc-diagram__node cdc-diagram__node--app"></rect>
        <text class="cdc-diagram__node-num" x="14" y="24">01</text>
        <text class="cdc-diagram__node-title" x="36" y="24">應用層服務</text>
        <text class="cdc-diagram__node-sub" x="14" y="48">純粹寫入 DB 主庫</text
        >
      </g>

      <!-- Arrow 1 -> 2 -->
      <path
        d="M 175 102 L 205 102"
        class="cdc-diagram__flow-line"
        marker-end="url(#cdc-arrow)"></path>

      <!-- Step 2: MySQL (X: 215, Y: 70, W: 165, H: 65) -->
      <g transform="translate(215, 70)">
        <rect
          width="165"
          height="65"
          rx="8"
          class="cdc-diagram__node cdc-diagram__node--mysql"></rect>
        <text class="cdc-diagram__node-num" x="14" y="24">02</text>
        <text class="cdc-diagram__node-title" x="36" y="24">MySQL 主庫</text>
        <text class="cdc-diagram__node-sub" x="14" y="48"
          >寫入並生成 Binlog</text
        >
      </g>

      <!-- Arrow 2 -> 3 (Down to CDC) -->
      <path
        d="M 297 135 L 297 155 L 405 155"
        class="cdc-diagram__flow-line cdc-diagram__flow-line--purple"
        marker-end="url(#cdc-arrow)"></path>

      <!-- Step 3: CDC Engine (X: 415, Y: 130, W: 175, H: 55) -->
      <g transform="translate(415, 130)">
        <rect
          width="175"
          height="55"
          rx="8"
          class="cdc-diagram__node cdc-diagram__node--cdc"></rect>
        <text class="cdc-diagram__node-num" x="14" y="22">03</text>
        <text class="cdc-diagram__node-title" x="36" y="22"
          >Canal / Debezium</text
        >
        <text class="cdc-diagram__node-sub" x="14" y="42"
          >即時解析 Binlog 事件</text
        >
      </g>

      <!-- Arrow 3 -> 4 -->
      <path
        d="M 590 157 L 615 157"
        class="cdc-diagram__flow-line cdc-diagram__flow-line--amber"
        marker-end="url(#cdc-arrow)"></path>

      <!-- Step 4: Kafka (X: 625, Y: 130, W: 155, H: 55) -->
      <g transform="translate(625, 130)">
        <rect
          width="155"
          height="55"
          rx="8"
          class="cdc-diagram__node cdc-diagram__node--kafka"></rect>
        <text class="cdc-diagram__node-num" x="14" y="22">04</text>
        <text class="cdc-diagram__node-title" x="36" y="22"
          >Kafka / MQ 佇列</text
        >
        <text class="cdc-diagram__node-sub" x="14" y="42">變更持久化與重試</text
        >
      </g>

      <!-- Arrow 4 -> 5 (Up & Left to Worker) -->
      <path
        d="M 702 130 L 702 102 L 605 102"
        class="cdc-diagram__flow-line cdc-diagram__flow-line--green"
        marker-end="url(#cdc-arrow)"></path>

      <!-- Step 5: Worker & Redis (X: 415, Y: 70, W: 180, H: 48) -->
      <g transform="translate(415, 70)">
        <rect
          width="180"
          height="48"
          rx="8"
          class="cdc-diagram__node cdc-diagram__node--redis"></rect>
        <text class="cdc-diagram__node-num" x="14" y="20">05</text>
        <text class="cdc-diagram__node-title" x="36" y="20"
          >淘汰 Worker ➔ Redis</text
        >
        <text class="cdc-diagram__node-sub" x="14" y="38"
          >冪等 DEL，業務完全解耦</text
        >
      </g>
    </g>
  </svg>

  <!-- Mobile HTML Layout (<= 48rem) -->
  <div class="cdc-diagram__mobile">
    <div class="cdc-diagram__m-card">
      <div class="cdc-diagram__m-badge">ASYNC CDC FLOW</div>
      <h4 class="cdc-diagram__m-title">Binlog CDC 快取淘汰步驟</h4>
      <div class="cdc-diagram__m-steps">
        <div class="cdc-diagram__m-step">
          <span class="cdc-diagram__m-num">1</span>
          <div>
            <strong>應用服務寫入</strong>
            <p>
              應用層僅純粹更新 MySQL
              主庫，不承擔快取淘汰責任，徹底消除業務複雜度。
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="cdc-diagram__m-step">
          <span class="cdc-diagram__m-num">2</span>
          <div>
            <strong>Binlog 事件捕獲</strong>
            <p>
              Canal 或 Debezium 模擬 MySQL 備庫協議，即時捕獲 Row 級別變更日誌。
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="cdc-diagram__m-step">
          <span class="cdc-diagram__m-num">3</span>
          <div>
            <strong>訊息佇列緩衝</strong>
            <p>
              將變更事件投遞至 Kafka / MQ，提供削峰、持久化重試與死信防禦機制。
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="cdc-diagram__m-step">
          <span class="cdc-diagram__m-num">4</span>
          <div>
            <strong>Worker 冪等刪除</strong>
            <p>
              消費者 Worker 讀取訊息，精準執行 <code>DEL key</code
              >，並天然適應主從複製延遲。
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <figcaption id="cdc-diagram-caption" class="cdc-diagram__caption">
    圖：基於 MySQL Binlog CDC 與 Kafka 的非同步快取解耦淘汰架構
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .cdc-diagram {
    margin: 2.5rem 0;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 1rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--dg-border);
    background: var(--dg-bg);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .cdc-diagram__desktop {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
  }

  .cdc-diagram__mobile {
    display: none;
  }

  /* SVG Styling */
  .cdc-diagram__card {
    fill: var(--dg-card);
    stroke: var(--dg-border);
    stroke-width: 1.5;
  }

  .cdc-diagram__badge {
    fill: var(--dg-muted);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;
  }

  .cdc-diagram__title {
    fill: var(--dg-title);
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;
  }

  .cdc-diagram__node {
    stroke-width: 1.5;
  }

  .cdc-diagram__node--app {
    fill: var(--dg-card-soft);
    stroke: var(--dg-blue);
  }

  .cdc-diagram__node--mysql {
    fill: var(--dg-card-soft);
    stroke: var(--dg-blue);
  }

  .cdc-diagram__node--cdc {
    fill: var(--dg-card-soft);
    stroke: var(--dg-purple);
  }

  .cdc-diagram__node--kafka {
    fill: var(--dg-card-soft);
    stroke: var(--dg-amber);
  }

  .cdc-diagram__node--redis {
    fill: var(--dg-card-soft);
    stroke: var(--dg-green);
  }

  .cdc-diagram__node-num {
    fill: var(--dg-muted);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-family: monospace;
  }

  .cdc-diagram__node-title {
    fill: var(--dg-title);
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;
  }

  .cdc-diagram__node-sub {
    fill: var(--dg-muted);
    font-size: 11.5px;
    font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;
  }

  .cdc-diagram__flow-line {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--dg-blue);
    stroke-width: 2;
  }

  .cdc-diagram__flow-line--purple {
    stroke: var(--dg-purple);
  }

  .cdc-diagram__flow-line--amber {
    stroke: var(--dg-amber);
  }

  .cdc-diagram__flow-line--green {
    stroke: var(--dg-green);
  }

  .cdc-diagram__arrow-head {
    fill: var(--dg-blue);
  }

  .cdc-diagram__caption {
    margin-top: 1rem;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--dg-muted);
    text-align: center;
  }

  /* Responsive Mobile */
  @media (max-width: 48rem) {
    .cdc-diagram__desktop {
      display: none;
    }

    .cdc-diagram__mobile {
      display: block;
    }

    .cdc-diagram__m-card {
      background: var(--dg-card);
      border: 1px solid var(--dg-border);
      border-radius: 0.75rem;
      padding: 1.25rem;
    }

    .cdc-diagram__m-badge {
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--dg-muted);
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
    }

    .cdc-diagram__m-title {
      font-size: 1.125rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--dg-title);
      margin: 0 0 1.25rem 0;
    }

    .cdc-diagram__m-steps {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 1rem;
    }

    .cdc-diagram__m-step {
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 0.75rem;
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      color: var(--dg-body);
    }

    .cdc-diagram__m-step strong {
      display: block;
      color: var(--dg-title);
      margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
    }

    .cdc-diagram__m-step p {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 0.8125rem;
      color: var(--dg-muted);
      line-height: 1.45;
    }

    .cdc-diagram__m-num {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      width: 1.5rem;
      height: 1.5rem;
      border-radius: 9999px;
      background: var(--dg-card-soft);
      border: 1px solid var(--dg-border);
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--dg-blue);
      flex-shrink: 0;
      margin-top: 0.125rem;
    }
  }

  /* Tokens & Theme */
  .cdc-diagram {
    --dg-bg: var(--color-card, #f8fafc);
    --dg-card: var(--color-surface, #ffffff);
    --dg-card-soft: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.03);
    --dg-border: var(--color-border, #e2e8f0);
    --dg-title: #0f172a;
    --dg-body: #334155;
    --dg-muted: #64748b;
    --dg-blue: #2563eb;
    --dg-green: #16a34a;
    --dg-purple: #7c3aed;
    --dg-amber: #d97706;
  }

  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .cdc-diagram {
    --dg-bg: #0d1117;
    --dg-card: #161b22;
    --dg-card-soft: #21262d;
    --dg-border: #30363d;
    --dg-title: #f0f6fc;
    --dg-body: #c9d1d9;
    --dg-muted: #8b949e;
    --dg-blue: #58a6ff;
    --dg-green: #3fb950;
    --dg-purple: #bc8cff;
    --dg-amber: #d29922;
  }
</style>
